# Skills location

- **Source of truth**: put all skill source under `.claude/skills/<skill-name>/`
- **Cursor discovery**: `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>` must be a **symlink** to `../../.claude/skills/<skill-name>`
- Do **not** keep a second copy of skill files under `.cursor/skills/`
- New / moved skills: write in `.claude/skills/`, then add the `.cursor/skills/` symlink

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
.claude/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/my-skill -> ../../.claude/skills/my-skill

# ❌ BAD
.cursor/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md   # real copy
.claude/skills/my-skill -> ../../.cursor/skills/my-skill  # reverse symlink
```
